WEBVTT

00:00.580 --> 00:02.380
Ninachotaka kufanya sasa ni mfuatano

00:02.380 --> 00:05.570
wa maswali yanayotufanya tujue tulichokuwa tunakifanya

00:05.570 --> 00:09.530
kwenye mistari sambamba na pembetatu na zote zilizobakia.

00:09.530 --> 00:12.410
Tulichonacho hapa ni swali la kisasa kabisa.

00:12.410 --> 00:15.070
Ninachotaka kufanya nikujua,

00:15.070 --> 00:16.570
taarifa tulizopewa hapa--kama inavyoonekana.

00:16.570 --> 00:18.310
Nina pembetatu hapa.

00:18.310 --> 00:20.380
Nina pembetatu nyingine hapa.

00:20.380 --> 00:24.020
Tulipewa baadhi ya pembe ndani ya pembetatu hizi.

00:24.020 --> 00:26.400
Kutokana na maelezo tuliyopewa hapa, ninataka

00:26.400 --> 00:29.400
kujua kipimo cha pembe hizi

00:29.400 --> 00:30.850
hapa.

00:30.850 --> 00:33.616
Natakiwa kujua hii alama ya kiulizo ni nini.

00:33.616 --> 00:35.490
Na unataka kuendelea nayo kwa

00:35.490 --> 00:39.570
kujua kile unachojua kuhusu jumla ya vipimo

00:39.570 --> 00:42.130
vya pembe ndani ya pembetatu, na labda

00:42.130 --> 00:44.630
kile kidogo unachokijua kuhusu pembenyoofu.

00:44.630 --> 00:47.740
Hivyo unaweza simama kidogo na ujaribu mwenyewe

00:47.740 --> 00:50.214
kwa sababu nitakupa njia.

00:50.214 --> 00:51.630
Hivyo kitu cha kwanza unachoweza kusema--

00:51.630 --> 00:53.330
na hii ni njia ya jumla ya kufikiria

00:53.330 --> 00:55.510
kuhusu maswali mengi ya pembe unayopewa

00:55.510 --> 00:57.300
na unatakiwa kujua pembe nyingine kulingana na

00:57.300 --> 00:59.630
jumla ya pembe na pembetatu ni sawa na 180,

00:59.630 --> 01:01.850
au hii hapa haina mstari sambamba.

01:01.850 --> 01:04.080
Lakini waweza kuziona nyingine na mstari sambamba

01:04.080 --> 01:06.440
na vikamilisho vya pembe nyoofu na vikamilisho vya pembe mraba--

01:06.440 --> 01:09.100
ni kujaza kila kitu unachokiona,

01:09.100 --> 01:11.010
na njia moja au nyingine,

01:11.010 --> 01:14.290
unaweza kuona hii alama ya kiulizo ni nini.

01:14.290 --> 01:16.310
Hivyo kitu cha kwanza kinachonijia

01:16.310 --> 01:18.810
ni hapa tuna pembetatu moja hapa.

01:18.810 --> 01:21.030
tuna pembetatu kushoto.

01:21.030 --> 01:22.440
Na kwenye pembetatu hii kushoto,

01:22.440 --> 01:24.254
tumepewa pembe 2.

01:24.254 --> 01:26.170
Na kama una pembe 2 kwenye pembe tatu,

01:26.170 --> 01:28.130
unaweza kupata pembe ya tatu

01:28.130 --> 01:31.650
kwasababu zinakwenda kujumlisha mpaka nyuzi 180.

01:31.650 --> 01:38.550
Kama ukiita hii x, tunajua kwamba x jumlisha 50 jumlisha 64

01:38.550 --> 01:41.300
itakuwa ni sawa na nyuzi 180.

01:41.300 --> 01:45.860
Au tunaweza kusema x jumlisha, 114.

01:45.860 --> 01:49.240
X jumlisha 114 ni sawa na nyuzi 180.

01:49.240 --> 01:53.160
Tunatoa 114 pande zote za mlinganyo,

01:53.160 --> 01:59.220
na tunapa x ni sawa na 180 toa 114.

01:59.220 --> 02:01.186
80 toa 14.

02:01.186 --> 02:05.550
80 toa 10 itakuwa 70, toa 4 ni 66.

02:05.550 --> 02:08.690
X ni nyuzi 66.

02:08.690 --> 02:11.307
Kama x ni nyuzi 66, nadhani

02:11.307 --> 02:13.140
utagundua kuna pembe nyingine

02:13.140 --> 02:14.580
ambayo si ngumu kutafuta .

02:14.580 --> 02:16.360
Nitaandika hivi.

02:19.830 --> 02:22.080
X ni sawa na nyuzi 66.

02:25.099 --> 02:26.890
Kama tunajua pembe hii hapa,

02:26.890 --> 02:29.630
ni nyuzi 66,

02:29.630 --> 02:32.970
tunajua hii pembe ni pembe nyoofu

02:32.970 --> 02:34.730
yenye pembe hii hapa.

02:34.730 --> 02:37.260
Pande zake za nje zinataengeneza pembe kali,

02:37.260 --> 02:38.640
na kitacho chake.

02:38.640 --> 02:40.710
Kama tukiita pembe hii hapa

02:40.710 --> 02:44.170
y, tunajua y jumlisha x itakuwa

02:44.170 --> 02:47.750
sawa na nyuzi 180.

02:47.750 --> 02:50.860
Na x ni sawa na nyuzi 66.

02:50.860 --> 02:52.120
Hivyo hii ni 66.

02:52.120 --> 02:55.540
Hivyo tunatoa 66 kila upande,

02:55.540 --> 03:00.900
na tunapata y ni sawa sawa--hii inaisha--180 toa 66

03:00.900 --> 03:02.760
ni 114.

03:02.760 --> 03:05.110
Na namba hii inaonekana sio ngeni kwako.

03:05.110 --> 03:08.340
Kumbuka, hii 114 ni ile jumla ya

03:08.340 --> 03:10.790
pembe hizi mbili hapa.

03:10.790 --> 03:12.260
Hili ndio wazo zima,

03:12.260 --> 03:15.270
na utafanya upande huu ili kuhakiki.

03:15.270 --> 03:18.124
Kama nina pembe 2--tuseme

03:18.124 --> 03:19.540
kipimo cha pembe hii

03:19.540 --> 03:21.490
ni a, kipimo cha pembe ile ni

03:21.490 --> 03:23.340
b, na kipimo cha pembe hii

03:23.340 --> 03:26.800
tunajua kitakuwa nyuzi 180 toa a toa b.

03:26.800 --> 03:29.250
Hii ni pembe hii hapa.

03:29.250 --> 03:31.290
Halafu pembe hii, ambayo tunasema

03:31.290 --> 03:32.990
ni ya nje.

03:32.990 --> 03:35.440
Kwenye mfano huu, y ni pembe ya nje.

03:35.440 --> 03:38.220
Kwenye mfano huu hii ndio pembe yetu ya nje.

03:38.220 --> 03:40.090
Hii itakuwa pembenyoofu kwenye 180

03:40.090 --> 03:41.650
toa a toa b.

03:41.650 --> 03:45.230
Pembe hii jumlisha 180 toa a toa b

03:45.230 --> 03:46.730
ni sawa na nyuzi 180.

03:46.730 --> 03:48.920
Kama ukiita hii pembe y, utakuwa na

03:48.920 --> 03:57.730
y jumlisha 180 toa a toa b ni sawa na 180.

03:57.730 --> 03:59.990
Unaweza kutoa 180 kila upande.

03:59.990 --> 04:02.160
Unajumlisha a jumlisha b kila upande.

04:02.160 --> 04:06.080
Hivyo a jumlisha b.

04:06.080 --> 04:08.050
Nafasi inaniishia upande wa kulia.

04:08.050 --> 04:10.820
Unabakiwa na--hii inaisha.

04:10.820 --> 04:12.680
Upande wa kushoto, unabakiwa na y.

04:12.680 --> 04:15.230
Upande wa kulia ni sawa sawa na a jumlisha b.

04:15.230 --> 04:17.089
Huu ndio utaratibu mzima.

04:17.089 --> 04:19.430
Unaweza kujipa sababu mwenyewe

04:19.430 --> 04:23.680
kutokana na jumla ya vipimo vya pembe za ndani

04:23.680 --> 04:26.020
ya pembetatu vyenye jumla ya nyuzi 180,

04:26.020 --> 04:28.200
na kisha una pembe suplimentari

04:28.200 --> 04:28.950
hapa.

04:28.950 --> 04:31.940
Au unaweza sema, kama nina pembe ya nje

04:31.940 --> 04:35.220
hapa, ni jumla ya pembe

04:35.220 --> 04:36.972
za ndani.

04:36.972 --> 04:39.180
Huu ni msamiati mdogo unauona hapa.

04:39.180 --> 04:41.220
Hivyo y ni sawa na a jumlisha b.

04:41.220 --> 04:44.240
nyuzi 114, tumeshaona ni

04:44.240 --> 04:47.380
sawa na 64 jumlisha nyuzi 50.

04:47.380 --> 04:49.005
Lakini haijalishi tumeifanyaje,

04:49.005 --> 04:50.670
kama tukiitazama hatua kwa hatua

04:50.670 --> 04:53.090
au kama tungejua mapema

04:53.090 --> 04:54.987
kama tunajua y ni sawa na nyuzi 114--

04:54.987 --> 04:57.320
na ninapenda kuitafakari kila mara ili kuhakikisha

04:57.320 --> 05:00.290
sikimbilii kumaliza.

05:00.290 --> 05:03.050
Kama y ni nyuzi 114, sasa tunaijua pembe hii.

05:03.050 --> 05:05.192
Tulipewa pembe hii mwanzoni.

05:05.192 --> 05:07.150
Sasa tunatakiwa kujua hii pembe ya tatu

05:07.150 --> 05:08.920
kwenye pembe hii.

05:08.920 --> 05:12.930
Kama tunaiita hii z, kama tunasema kiulizo hiki ni

05:12.930 --> 05:20.710
sawa na z, tunajua kwamba z jumlisha 114 jumlisha 31

05:20.710 --> 05:23.170
ni sawa na nyuzi 180.

05:23.170 --> 05:26.460
Jumla ya pembe za ndani ya pembetatu

05:26.460 --> 05:27.770
ni jumla ya nyuzi 180.

05:27.770 --> 05:30.290
Hii ndio njia pekee tunatumia kwenye hii.

05:30.290 --> 05:38.520
Tunapata z jumlisha 145 ni sawa na 180.

05:38.520 --> 05:39.560
Nimepatia?

05:39.560 --> 05:42.962
Tuna 15, kisha 30.

05:42.962 --> 05:45.350
145 ni sawa na 180.

05:45.350 --> 05:49.070
Toa 145 kila upande kwenye huu mlinganyo,

05:49.070 --> 05:56.840
na tumebakiwa na z ni sawa na 80 jumlisha 45 ni sawa na 35.

05:56.840 --> 06:02.580
Hivyo z ni sawa na nyuzi 35, na tumemaliza.
